@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

# Interactive alternative: Swagger UI at http://localhost:8000/swagger (OpenAPI document: /openapi/v1.json).

# IDs in the seeded database are random per container. Take an order ID from
# "Get all orders" and a product ID from "Get order by ID", then paste them below.
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get all orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### Get order by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### Task 1: Get orders with a status (matching ignores case, spaces and separators)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/status/Failed

### Task 1: "InProgress" resolves to the stored "In Progress"
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/status/InProgress

### Task 1: Unknown status -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/status/Shipped

### Task 2: Update order status -> 204
# Workflow is forward-only: Created -> In Progress -> Completed | Failed (Completed and Failed are final).
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InProgress"
}

### Task 2: Transition not allowed by the workflow (e.g. back to Created) -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Created"
}

### Task 2: Unknown status -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Shipped"
}

### Task 2: Unknown order -> 404
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### Task 3: Create order -> 201 with Location header
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resellerId": "6f9a3f4e-2a8b-4c1d-9e7f-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
  "customerId": "0d1e2f3a-4b5c-6d7e-8f90-a1b2c3d4e5f6",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 5 }
  ]
}

### Task 3: Invalid order -> 400 listing every error
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resellerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "quantity": 0 }
  ]
}

### Task 4: Profit by month for completed orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/profit/monthly
